    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Давай еще на десять минут переведем.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Let's snooze it for another ten minutes.' When the morning alarm rings, a sleepy Max suggests snoozing it for ten more minutes. And Sasha jumps in.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "sasha",
      "t": "Опять?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Again?' Sasha groans and asks if he is hitting snooze again.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Ага.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Yeah.' Max mumbles a sleepy 'yeah' from under the covers.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "sasha",
      "t": "Давай вообще на работу не пойдем.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Let's just skip work altogether.' Tempted to stay in bed, Sasha suggests they skip work altogether today. Max answers straight away.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Давай.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Let's.' Half-asleep, Max happily agrees to the idea at first.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Я так хочу спать.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I want to sleep so much.' He admits he is so exhausted that all he wants to do is sleep.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "sasha",
      "t": "Я тоже.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Me too.' Sasha says she feels the exact same way. Then Max replies.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Можно просто остаться дома.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We can just stay home.' Max muses that they really could just stay home all day.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "sasha",
      "t": "Это плохая идея.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That is a bad idea.' Coming to her senses, Sasha realizes skipping their shift is a terrible idea.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "sasha",
      "t": "Нас уволят.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'They will fire us.' She reminds him that the restaurant would fire them both. And Max jumps in.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Тогда надо вставать.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then we need to get up.' Reluctantly accepting reality, Max sighs that they have to get up then.",
      "gap": 0.4
    },
    {
      "v": "sasha",
      "t": "Доброе утро.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
